              "en": "A toddler who knows dogs points at a cow and says \"dog\". The new animal fits an old idea: <mark>assimilation</mark>.",
              "as": "A toddler who knows dogs points at a cow and says \"dog\". The new animal fits an old idea: <mark>assimilation</mark>."
            },
            {
              "en": "Told it moos and gives milk, the child forms a new category: <mark>accommodation</mark>. Jean <mark>Piaget</mark> saw children as active builders of knowledge.",
              "as": "Told it moos and gives milk, the child forms a new category: <mark>accommodation</mark>. Jean <mark>Piaget</mark> saw children as active builders of knowledge."
            }
